Karkov is a human [[Bestiary/Realmtouched#Duskwalker|Duskwalker]] in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]]. He is in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Sarengrad|Sarengrad]], and legions of people who agree with him follow him. He has taken all three of the [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessian]] bloods at once, which makes him more powerful.

The [[Org/Althane/The Weft|Weft]] knew Karkov as a coworker, and hold that he does what he believes is best for everyone.
